{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is a limited version that lets you experience incubation, evolution, and core mechanics of the Minsgon world. Add the full game to your wishlist for the complete experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Store, Shape Your World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own shop and stock your shelves with products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers shop according to their interests and budgets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take payments at the counter, give the correct change, and boost customer satisfaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/1446d01a2a0147d17e4a9f72cff98754.poster.avif?t=1756997067\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/1446d01a2a0147d17e4a9f72cff98754.webm?t=1756997067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/1446d01a2a0147d17e4a9f72cff98754.mp4?t=1756997067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Incubate Mysterious Eggs</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place eggs in incubators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, Minsgons with different traits will hatch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare eggs may produce Minsgons that become the most valuable part of your collection.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/2da90aea5ccd29be95de5696333ecd64.poster.avif?t=1756997067\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/2da90aea5ccd29be95de5696333ecd64.webm?t=1756997067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/2da90aea5ccd29be95de5696333ecd64.mp4?t=1756997067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Train Your Minsgons</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your Minsgons into training capsules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level them up and unlock new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trained Minsgons make a difference both in trade and in the Olympics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/c2d8d18b1a66d2e043a3c634759a1f66.poster.avif?t=1756997067\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/c2d8d18b1a66d2e043a3c634759a1f66.webm?t=1756997067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/c2d8d18b1a66d2e043a3c634759a1f66.mp4?t=1756997067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve Into Powerful New Forms</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minsgons that grow strong enough evolve into more majestic forms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution increases not only their battle power but also their collectible value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare evolution forms are priceless to collectors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/4cb00e98014682c74423f21cbf6e186f.poster.avif?t=1756997067\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/4cb00e98014682c74423f21cbf6e186f.webm?t=1756997067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/4cb00e98014682c74423f21cbf6e186f.mp4?t=1756997067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete in the Olympics and Prove Your Strength</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Minsgon Olympics, compete in speed, flight, firepower, jaw strength, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each competition requires different strategies and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you win, prestige and rewards await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Showcase Your Collection and Trade</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display the Minsgons you hatch or train in your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your rare Minsgons at your stand or keep them for yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With smart choices, you can rise to the top in both trade and the Olympics!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/5fd4e5eb10eeb4c1224e27c4370bfa63.poster.avif?t=1756997067\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/5fd4e5eb10eeb4c1224e27c4370bfa63.webm?t=1756997067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992920/extras/5fd4e5eb10eeb4c1224e27c4370bfa63.mp4?t=1756997067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Store and Become the Greatest</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a small shop and grow step by step.</p